{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50197","headline":"在哥舒大夫幕下请辞退托兴奉诗（伯三八一二。下同） · 高适","name":"在哥舒大夫幕下请辞退托兴奉诗（伯三八一二。下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自从嫁与君，不省一日乐。\n遣妾作歌舞，好时还道恶。\n不是妾无堪，君家妇难作。\n下堂辞君去，去後君莫错。\n（项云：「《才调集》卷六李白《寒女吟》，後幅与此诗大略相同。\n」《寒女吟》收《全唐诗续补遗》李白名下，兹不重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}